\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Come back to God, come back to God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou oh wanderer who is lost!
\par come with prayer and repentance
\par come to The Saviour your God
\par Come in what ever state, Oh! Come.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Come and worship Christ your Saviour
\par Look, Him self is ever calling
\par and His Gospel tells you so
\par by His grace He will receive you,
\par come back never hesitate.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Repent from all earthly joy and
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 come and follow Jesus Christ.
\par He will save you from all worries
\par and will give you happiness
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He will give you peace in your life
\par and give you his Holy Spirit;
\par Then His spirit bears you witness
\par and will make you His own son.
\par You will follow Christ your Saviour
\par and have everlasting life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. And so, to you all backsliders
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   Return to the Lord your God
\par   Jesus Christ our Lord and saviour
\par   by His blood has saved us all.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He will save you from all evil
\par   and the wickedness of evil.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And the son of God your master,
\par The Creator and Saviour
\par and so do not stop to serve Him
\par And don't circumvent His grace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. God call all His children to come
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 but a few do hear his call
\par He will save one soul from a town
\par and the rest will disappear
\par from a family will come two,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par to join the folks of Christ's Kingdom
\par But their number will be so great
\par They come from parts of the world
\par But God says He will take a soul
\par to be a thousand people.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  The people of God shall be free
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj and in His kingdom will gain
\par no more trouble, no more hunger;
\par and His blessings they receive.
\par He will give to them the shepherds
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj and will give them strength to guide them
\par they will never judge them falsely
\par and also hold them so tight
\par To make them receive all the gains
\par \pard      all good wisdom and knowledge. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

